# Cross-origin isolation so wllama can use multi-threaded WASM
# (SharedArrayBuffer) — 2-4x faster CPU inference where WebGPU is off.
# `credentialless` (not `require-corp`) keeps cross-origin bookmark
# favicons working. Do not remove: without these, WASM falls back
# to a single thread. Browsers that don't understand the values
# simply ignore them (same as today).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
